+# Handoff — P2-1 Design tokens and app shell
+
+## Task
+- Phase: 2 | Task ID: P2-1 | Date: 2026-10-21
+- Branch / commit (verified): `main` @ `1c81f29` (fresh clone). P2-1 changes are UNCOMMITTED in the sandbox; owner commits/pushes.
+
+## Summary
+- What changed: approved palette -> semantic tokens (light only); components `button`, `input`, `label`, `checkbox`, `alert`; shared layout (skip link, header, footer, page container); root layout is the shell; placeholder home page uses it. No new dependencies.
+- Acceptance: approved tokens used consistently (no hex/palette classes outside `globals.css`); primary button label is navy; yellow restrained; builds clean. NOT claimed: Phase 2 complete (auth, protected routes, wizard remain).
+
+## Files
+### Created
+- `src/components/ui/button.tsx`, `input.tsx`, `label.tsx`, `checkbox.tsx`, `alert.tsx`
+- `src/components/layout/skip-link.tsx`, `site-header.tsx`, `site-footer.tsx`, `page-container.tsx`
+- `ai/handoff/P2-1.md`
+### Modified
+- `src/app/globals.css` (tokens), `src/app/layout.tsx` (shell), `src/app/page.tsx` (uses `PageContainer`, no own `<main>`)
+- `ai/CHANGELOG.md`, `ai/CURRENT_STATE.md`, `ai/ROADMAP.md`, `ai/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `ai/DECISIONS.md` (ADR-019, ADR-017 note)
+### Deleted
+- None (a temporary `src/app/zz-preview/` page was created for visual testing and removed before the diff review).
+
+## Verification
+- Commands: `npm ci`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, `npm run build`, `next start` + Playwright/Chromium screenshots and DOM checks, contrast script, grep scans. Results: see CURRENT_STATE.md "Verification P2-1".
+- Not run: component/unit tests (no runner), screen reader, other browsers, real devices. No provider/DB checks (out of scope).
+
+## Decisions / risks
+- ADR-019 (PROPOSED). Owner to confirm: tints/red outside the 4-color palette (info, warning, destructive, muted text, secondary); light-only; native checkbox and no Radix.
+- Header has no nav links on purpose (routes don't exist yet); use the `children` slot when auth screens land.
+- Pre-existing doc discrepancy: Phase 1/schema are committed but old docs said uncommitted; `phase1.patch` still in repo root; `ai/` vs `.ai/` unresolved; `AGENTS.md` is rewritten by `next dev`.
+
+## Next task
+- Wizard skeleton: stepper + terms gate (5 terms, explicit acceptance) + draft state surviving step navigation, using these components. Auth screens after ADR-012 approval.
